    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/969760/extras/b5462f3f3048420bc3b2cd971f28684b.poster.avif?t=1751271049\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/969760/extras/b5462f3f3048420bc3b2cd971f28684b.webm?t=1751271049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/969760/extras/b5462f3f3048420bc3b2cd971f28684b.mp4?t=1751271049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br>Omno whisks you away on a journey of discovery through an ancient world of wonders. It\u2019s a single-player adventure full of puzzles, secrets, and obstacles to overcome.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/969760/extras/2d6d03f505b31469710c6fc5764205e1.webp?t=1751271049\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/969760/extras/968d21beb4ba58e3e4499dc1f1d700d9.poster.avif?t=1751271049\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/969760/extras/968d21beb4ba58e3e4499dc1f1d700d9.webm?t=1751271049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/969760/extras/968d21beb4ba58e3e4499dc1f1d700d9.mp4?t=1751271049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br>The power of a lost civilisation will carry you on an epic quest through lush forests, sun-blasted deserts, and frozen tundras - even to the clouds.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/969760/extras/2d6d03f505b31469710c6fc5764205e1.webp?t=1751271049\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/969760/extras/0bef44fb4a849624fbe897bdcd0bc74d.poster.avif?t=1751271049\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/969760/extras/0bef44fb4a849624fbe897bdcd0bc74d.webm?t=1751271049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/969760/extras/0bef44fb4a849624fbe897bdcd0bc74d.mp4?t=1751271049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br>On your way, you\u2019ll discover a vibrant world full of strange and wonderful lifeforms, from cute little critters to enigmatic giants, and everything in between. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/969760/extras/2d6d03f505b31469710c6fc5764205e1.webp?t=1751271049\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/969760/extras/b3841196e08e0269dce8549e3fc490a3.poster.avif?t=1751271049\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/969760/extras/b3841196e08e0269dce8549e3fc490a3.webm?t=1751271049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/969760/extras/b3841196e08e0269dce8549e3fc490a3.mp4?t=1751271049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br>Jonas Manke, solo developer and father of 3, began work on Omno as a hobby project 5 years ago after working as an animator in both games and movies.",
